":"pins","d":"2019-08-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"The third area is going down market into the SMB space, in particular with digitally native brands like Buffy, a direct-to-consumer bedding company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/pinterest-inc-pins-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2019 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2019-08-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ben Silbermann","x":"Todd mentioned as an example Buffy, which is direct-to-consumer brand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/pinterest-inc-pins-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2019 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ben Silbermann","x":"I'll take the first question and then pass it on to Todd.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/pinterest-inc-pins-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2019 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2019-10-31","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"We saw a fair amount of strength in three areas from a customer segment perspective, CPG advertisers, direct-to-consumer advertisers and in the SMB space that Ben had referenced a bit earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/pinterest-inc-pins-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2020 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"You might imagine that omni-channel retail stores -- or omni-channel retailers that had stores that were closed had a significant pullback on spend, whereas direct-to-consumer brands grew relatively faster.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/pinterest-inc-pins-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2020 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"In fact, our direct-to-consumer advertising cohort grew significantly faster than the rest of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/pinterest-inc-pins-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2020 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ben Silbermann","x":"As you know, we withdrew annual guidance because we have limited visibility into future advertiser demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/pinterest-inc-pins-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2020 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"This was the result of implementing cost savings measures more quickly and our work from home model to a larger extent than we originally expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/pinterest-pins-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2020 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2020-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"And we've withdrawn our annual guidance because in this environment, just doesn't feel prudent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/pinterest-pins-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"PINS 2021 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ben Silbermann","x":"I'll now pass it on to Todd.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/pinterest-pins-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2021 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2021-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"There are things around that, around pivoting people from the grid format to streaming experiences, consuming some of our highest value ad slot inventory to distribute those Idea Pins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/pinterest-pins-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2021 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2021-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Todd Morgenfeld","x":"We're pivoting them from a grid format to a streaming format that consumes some of the time they would have spent on the platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/pinterest-pins-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2022 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2022-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Mahaney","x":"And then, secondly, Bill, I want to ask you just about AI and machine learning investments, and there seems to be a dramatic step-up in investments kind of across the industry just in that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/27/pinterest-pins-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2022 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2022-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Mahaney","x":"How do you see -- is there something dramatically different that you think can be done at Pinterest with greater investment in artificial intelligence and machine learning?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/27/pinterest-pins-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2022 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2023-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"We reduced our infrastructure spend, which declined sequentially despite strong engagement volume increases, and we closed some of our smaller offices for future cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/06/pinterest-pins-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2023-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"That is largely driven by improvements we have made in personalization and relevancy for users and really applying next-gen AI techniques, including things like GPUs, but pairing those with the really unique signal on our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/pinterest-pins-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2023-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"I think the primitives of generative AI are going to be broadly accessible via cloud compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/pinterest-pins-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2023-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"In Q1, we took further actions to drive longer-term efficiency in our business through our restructuring plan, which we announced at the end of March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/pinterest-pins-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2023-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"As part of this restructuring, we reduced our real estate footprint by downsizing or completely closing several of our offices around the globe as our flexible work policies do not require our historical levels of capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/04/28/pinterest-pins-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2023-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"In Q2, we expanded our use of GPU serving from core engagement AI models to our ad delivery models, which enabled us to use models that are 100x larger than before in ads, as well as organic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/01/pinterest-pins-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2023-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"As Bill mentioned, our investments in AI and new user experiences drove strong engagement on our platform in Q2, resulting in 465 million global monthly active users, an increase of over 30 million users over the last 12 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/01/pinterest-pins-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2023-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"In Q1, we took steps to reduce our expenses and drive greater efficiencies in our business, including rightsizing our workforce to align talent to our strategic priorities and restructuring our real estate portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/01/pinterest-pins-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2023-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"Our investments in increasing shopability and deploying AI across our recommendation engine are paying off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/30/pinterest-pins-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2023-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"…where, you know, our -- our use of large language models, you know, 100 times larger models, GPU serving, all these great AI technologies giving us significant increases in relevance, approximately 10 percentage point increase in relevance we talked about on -- on last quarter's call and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/30/pinterest-pins-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2023-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"This outperformed our expectations and is a reflection of our overall focus on expense management as we realized additional cost savings in the quarter on lower spend in technology and outside services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/30/pinterest-pins-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2024-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"During this period, we've made significant investments in AI that drove improvements in our overall platform for users and advertisers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/08/pinterest-pins-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2023 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2024-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"We've been strategic with our investments that enabled us to invest in high ROI projects, such as AI for content recommendation in ads and accelerating the pace of innovation across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/08/pinterest-pins-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2024-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"Let's start with our investments in AI to drive personalization and relevance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/pinterest-pins-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2024-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"The increase in non-GAAP operating expense year over year is driven by investment increases in R&D, where we are investing in headcount for AI talent across our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/01/pinterest-pins-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2024-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"First, we're helping our users more effectively find inspiration and discover new relevant content that resonates with their interest through our investments in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/31/pinterest-pins-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2024-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"We're continuing to invest in bolstering content discovery through generative AI-based guided search, which we first rolled out several months ago for the Home Decor vertical.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/31/pinterest-pins-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2024-11-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"The increase in non-GAAP operating expense year over year is driven by investment increases in R&D, where we continue to invest in headcount for AI talent and other product initiatives supporting users and monetization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/pinterest-pins-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2025-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthew Cost","x":"Can you talk a little bit about the GPU-enabled machine learning and GenAI areas that you think can be the most material drivers to further platform improvement in 2025?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/pinterest-pins-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2024 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2025-02-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"We're going to continue to invest in AI that drives great experiences for our users and better performance for our advertisers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/06/pinterest-pins-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"Taken together, these advances give us confidence that we can keep improving relevance, engagement, and advertiser performance while remaining disciplined on AI spend by leveraging Pinterest's unique first-party data.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"The increase was driven by headcount investments in marketing and R&D as we continue to invest in AI initiatives and grow our sales force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"While we absorbed an exogenous shock this year related to tariffs, disproportionately affecting ad spend from our top retail advertisers, this quarter also underscored where we need to move faster.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"Many of the largest retailers have been disproportionately hit by tariffs and have been pulling back on advertising spend across the industry as they seek to protect their margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"In January, we announced a restructuring, including a series of organizational changes to simplify how we operate, reduce layers, and increase efficiency so that we can invest more intentionally in the areas that matter most, especially AI and our go-to-market transformation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2025 Q4","e":"pins","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"It is also worth noting that we recently implemented a restructuring in January and are going through a sales and go-to-market transformation, and that may cause some near-term disruption, which we factored into our guidance to be prudent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/pinterest-pins-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cinema","r":"analyst","s":"William J. Ready","x":"It reaches Gen Z and millennial audiences across television, streaming, cinema, out-of-home, and digital channels through the end of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Brau Donnelly","x":"While these changes will take time to fully play out, we believe the progress we are making across the business and the outcomes from our AI investments will lead to durable growth over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Brau Donnelly","x":"The increase was primarily driven by Sales and Marketing due to headcount investments and marketing expenses, as well as R&D to support our AI and product initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julia Brau Donnelly","x":"And then, as a reminder, in Q2 we are also lapping more difficult comparisons in Rest of World and Europe due to the ramping of resellers last year and elevated cross-border spend following the introduction of US tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julia Brau Donnelly","x":"Those large retailers do continue to navigate some tariff-related margin pressure, though we are seeing some stability there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"William J. Ready","x":"We are also restructuring and reallocating resources so we can move faster in the parts of the market where we see the biggest opportunity, including mid-market, enterprise SMB, and international.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Helfstein","x":"And second, I know you are not guiding for next year, but is there any way to think about how we should be thinking about expenses for next year relative to what might be a higher level of investment this year after the headcount reduction?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q1","e":"pins","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"William J. Ready","x":"That is one tangible example we talked about on the call of how we can use our data on top of algorithms to get even better outcomes and is part of what we are doing with AI models generally—both what we build in-house and where we retrain open-source models.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/pinterest-pins-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"The increase was primarily driven by sales and marketing due to our brand campaign and sales headcount investments as well as R&D to support our AI and product initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/pinterest-pins-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"In Q3, within non-GAAP operating expense, our primary area of year-over-year investment will be sales and marketing and R&D to support our AI and product initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/pinterest-pins-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"So in Q2, we were lapping the ramp of resellers in Rest of World last year and lapping a significant influx of cross-border spend into Europe last year following changes in the U.S. tariff environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/pinterest-pins-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julia Donnelly","x":"So the restructuring actions we took in Q1 were really about aligning the organization with our highest priority opportunities and creating capacity to invest in the areas where we see the greatest potential returns, including AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/pinterest-pins-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q2","e":"pins","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"William Ready","x":"We're also making progress on our mid-market and managed SMB go-to-market efforts, including restructuring account coverage teams and realigning incentives to better serve this cohort over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/pinterest-pins-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"An ongoing focus for us is finding the right mix of talent, infrastructure, and AI-enabled productivity tooling to produce durable growth and expand margins over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"Within Q4 non-GAAP operating expense, the primary areas of year-over-year investment will be sales and marketing and R&D to support our AI and product initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"When tariffs went into effect in the U.S., many rerouted their spend into Europe and LATAM.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"What we saw in the U.S. was that these sort of tariff adjustments by advertisers can take a couple of quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"On revenue, we flagged two headwinds coming into the quarter affecting our international business, regulatory changes to the de minimis exemption in Europe affecting cross-border sellers, and the restructuring of our international go-to-market organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"The impact of our international go-to-market restructuring played out about as we expected and was a smaller contributor.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PINS 2026 Q3","e":"pins","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Bill Ready","x":"We believe the best AI experiences will expand human choice, not replace it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/02/pinterest-pins-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[37,1,7033,0,0,0,5353,1163],[38,1,6263,0,0,0,4562,1140],[39,1,6146,0,0,0,4525,1121],[40,1,8297,0,0,0,6389,1464],[41,1,6781,0,0,0,5222,1243],[42,1,7714,0,0,0,6088,1069],[43,1,8417,0,0,0,6152,1635],[44,1,8848,0,0,0,7379,1186],[45,1,8268,0,0,0,6714,1235],[46,1,8893,0,0,0,7217,1376],[48,1,7770,0,0,0,6458,920],[50,1,9291,0,0,0,8251,788],[51,1,10128,0,0,0,8582,1217],[52,1,10493,0,0,0,8993,1171],[53,1,10305,0,0,0,8694,1325],[54,1,10417,0,0,0,9260,866],[55,